  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF4i"
    Lines:
    - "Sau nhi\u1EC1u ng\xE0y tr\u1ED1ng tr\u1EADn vang r\u1EC1n, qu\xE2n s\u0129
      Hoa L\u01B0 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u th\u1EA5m m\u1EC7t. L\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EA3o
      c\u1EA1n d\u1EA7n, ru\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ECF hoang, d\xE2n ch\xFAng
      th\xECi nheo nh\xF3c v\xEC \u0111\xF3i. Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc t\xECnh th\u1EBF \u0111\xF3,
      \u0110inh Ho\xE0n quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh h\u1EA1 l\u1EC7nh b\u1EA5t ng\u1EDD:
      qu\xE2n l\xEDnh t\u1EA1m b\u1ECF g\u01B0\u01A1m gi\xE1o, c\xF9ng d\xE2n d\u1EF1ng
      l\u0169y, g\u1EB7t l\xFAa, khai kho th\xF3c c\u1EE9u \u0111\xF3i."
